<title>MEXICO: Liverpool Q1 net profit grows.</title>
<headline>Liverpool Q1 net profit grows.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997		     Q1 1996</p>
<p>Shr		 n.a.			   n.a.</p>
<p>Oper Income     26.78 million		18.26 million</p>
<p>Net		 142.865 million	    74.728 million</p>
<p>Revs		1.096 bln		    1.066 bln</p>
<p>Integ fin gain  67.76 million		113.12 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>Full company name is El Puerto de Liverpool SA</p>
</text>
